Note on the scientific content
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the B.I.R.D.S source code. It does not, and
cannot, extend to the published classification and discrimination schemes
the software implements. Those diagrams — their field boundaries and
discriminant functions — belong to their original authors and are cited in
each plot's subtitle and in the full bibliography (References → Show full
bibliography). Users are expected to cite those primary sources alongside
this software in any publication.
